                        "entry_id": "2940af6d-6367-3a22-a410-46c20960fd64",
                        "glosses": [
                            "That gives pleasure"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "fddca670-0012-431b-8941-30f5c95e3dc6",
                                "sense_id": "2ce5c3fb-74c3-37a0-8a85-e2372a1eca17",
                                "text": "The massage was a pleasurable experience."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6cbf311f-7678-408b-b67c-c72790f740b9",
                                "sense_id": "2ce5c3fb-74c3-37a0-8a85-e2372a1eca17",
                                "text": "c. 1620, Francis Bacon, letter of advice to Sir George Villiers\nPlanting of orchards is very […] pleasurable."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2ef74a05-32a2-47c1-8b81-d7ed2ec4fc18",
                                "sense_id": "2ce5c3fb-74c3-37a0-8a85-e2372a1eca17",
                                "text": "At Rome every Pleasurable Female pays a Julio per Week to the Church […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "af465e6d-cd4e-4c15-83d8-d3fc83f3cf6a",
                                "sense_id": "2ce5c3fb-74c3-37a0-8a85-e2372a1eca17",
                                "text": "Happiness is, therefore, a thing most excellent and noble, as well as being most pleasurable […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "57541be9-97b6-42f6-b06f-28ecb86a15c5",
                                "sense_id": "2ce5c3fb-74c3-37a0-8a85-e2372a1eca17",
                                "text": "Impassioned pleas for pleasurable instruction appeared from the pens of such thinkers as Plato, Sidney, and Dryden, this ideal ultimately becoming one of the acknowledged cornerstones of neoclassical criticism."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a88e7342-5b73-4581-bae5-89c40465def9",
                                "sense_id": "2ce5c3fb-74c3-37a0-8a85-e2372a1eca17",
                                "text": "Opiate receptors in human brains allow us to perceive pleasurable stimuli such as sweet tastes."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "20df2755-2fca-4429-98b8-8307f7bdb326",
                                "sense_id": "2ce5c3fb-74c3-37a0-8a85-e2372a1eca17",
                                "text": "They love good food, well prepared, truly fresh, and pleasurable."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "39c89013-f076-4f2a-9600-623b511c09d4",
                                "sense_id": "2ce5c3fb-74c3-37a0-8a85-e2372a1eca17",
                                "text": "This volume discusses pleasurable design — a part of the traditional usability design and evaluation methodologies."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "40c8c6f4-bd6c-4227-8567-d7739696dbcb",
                        "source_entry_id": "2940af6d-6367-3a22-a410-46c20960fd64",
                        "source_sense_id": "2ce5c3fb-74c3-37a0-8a85-e2372a1eca17",
                        "source_sense_description": "that gives pleasure",
                        "target_lang_word": "agréable",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "agréable",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "60fc0f0a-8bfc-3e3f-a8d4-73ce94f431f6",
                                        "entry_id": "ffebc51e-7c0c-339e-a1cb-c6b123ea2be2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Qui procure un sentiment de légère gaieté, de bonheur ou encore de bien-être."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "aaedd865-0f55-47c2-a587-18ffd50aa88c",
                                                "sense_id": "60fc0f0a-8bfc-3e3f-a8d4-73ce94f431f6",
                                                "text": "[…] ; une petite quantité de farine de seigle, mêlée à la farine de blé, lui communique une saveur agréable."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0bf10950-597c-4a0c-ba4e-71dd439b06f0",
                                                "sense_id": "60fc0f0a-8bfc-3e3f-a8d4-73ce94f431f6",
                                                "text": "Homme intelligent et sympathique, d'un commerce agréable, musulman convaincu mais tolérant, c’est un des rares Marocains qui ont tiré un profit réel de leur séjour en Europe."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "23dbdfcf-f161-48f2-8891-d1da7b0d67e2",
                                                "sense_id": "60fc0f0a-8bfc-3e3f-a8d4-73ce94f431f6",
                                                "text": "D’abord, les deux nouveaux venus parurent terribles, puis ils furent agréables et désirables comme des frères."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bc208442-126e-4b8b-beeb-c47e6e8a2411",
                                                "sense_id": "60fc0f0a-8bfc-3e3f-a8d4-73ce94f431f6",
                                                "text": "J’allai prendre congé des Danois et les remercier de ce qu’ils avaient fait pour nous être utiles et agréables."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "96156c23-1c91-400c-ab56-f63050c6614e",
                                                "sense_id": "60fc0f0a-8bfc-3e3f-a8d4-73ce94f431f6",
                                                "text": "Les 17 chambres sont agréables et claires, équipées d’écrans plats, d'un coffre fort individuel, la literie est neuve et l’accueil y est chaleureux."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "agréable",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1bc63631-a50e-3193-8118-3742bc9eecf6",
                                        "entry_id": "8d22317d-839e-3aa0-9312-9e7694a4e34f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Ce qui est agréable."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5705082f-222e-4daf-8209-168679ef459b",
                                                "sense_id": "1bc63631-a50e-3193-8118-3742bc9eecf6",
                                                "text": "Il ne faut pas sacrifier l’utile à l’agréable."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f0befe09-e80a-447e-845f-763b03c7ed73",
                                                "sense_id": "1bc63631-a50e-3193-8118-3742bc9eecf6",
                                                "text": "Il faut, certes, tenir compte des cas où l’agréable paraît se confondre avec le bon."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4fad6816-1e87-3ead-b130-94bdc9f7b85a",
                                        "entry_id": "8d22317d-839e-3aa0-9312-9e7694a4e34f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Personne qui cherche à plaire."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "dated"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "55dff5bf-c93e-42f5-8f81-3842353f5a46",
                                                "sense_id": "4fad6816-1e87-3ead-b130-94bdc9f7b85a",
                                                "text": "J'ai vu cet homme faire l’agréable auprès de ta femme."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "9554a8e6-7167-4b5e-9ff8-96e6f35f71f3",
                        "source_entry_id": "2940af6d-6367-3a22-a410-46c20960fd64",
